			"notes": "You can already use the **EMF** mod for versions 1.19.2-1.19.4, which works with Fresh Animations 1.8. \nBut has problems with other texturepacks. So stay tuned for updates.\n- For Custom Model: [EMF](https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features)\n- For Random Texture: [ETF](https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures)\n- For Config: [YACL](https://modrinth.com/mod/yacl)\n- For Optimise: [Entity Culling](https://modrinth.com/mod/entityculling)\n- Creator [Traben.](https://discord.com/invite/rURmwrzUcz)\n> \n> \n- Update to 1.19.4 \n>\n- For configure CEM need install [Mod menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu), [CompleteConfig](https://modrinth.com/mod/completeconfig) and [Cloth Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config).\n- Installing the [ETF](https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures) will fix some visual errors and extend the capabilities of the CEM mod.\n- Installing the [Animatica](https://modrinth.com/mod/animatica) will add animations for textures, e.g. blinking for eyes in FA Addon etc."
